---
metadata:
  name: quality-record-panel
  description: One fix run's copyable XHTML panel in the judge-jev quality report.
required_variables:
  - id
  - dom
  - kind
  - status
  - finished
  - before_step
  - after_step
  - outcomes
  - unsure
  - steps
  - candidates
  - chart_json
  - reviewed
  - runs
  - copy_json
  - context_text
defaults:
  title: ""
  file: ""
  doc_html: ""
  doc_changed: 0
  doc_stats: ""
  review_kept: []
  review_discarded: []
---
<section xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" class="card unit unit-record" id="{{ dom | e }}">
  <div class="card-head">
    <h2><span class="mono">{{ id | e }}</span> {{ title | e }} <span class="pill pill-{{ status | e }}"><i></i>{{ status | e }}</span></h2>
    <div class="tabs" role="group" aria-label="Copy run data">
      <button type="button" class="icon-button" title="Copy JSON" data-copy-text="{{ copy_json | e }}">{}</button>
      <button type="button" class="icon-button" title="Copy Context" data-copy-text="{{ context_text | e }}">&#x2398;</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="muted small">{{ kind | e }}{% if file %} · <span class="mono">{{ file | e }}</span>{% endif %} · <span class="mono">{{ before_step | e }}</span> → <span class="mono">{{ after_step | e }}</span></div>
{% if not finished %}
  <div class="callout warn">The run has no <span class="mono">final</span> step yet: this compares <span class="mono">base</span> with its latest step, <span class="mono">{{ after_step | e }}</span>.</div>
{% endif %}

  <h3 id="{{ dom | e }}-improved">What improved and why</h3>
  <p class="sub small">Each statement a rule fired on (a whole-record wave for an ADR), in how many runs it fired before and after, and the answers that explain it: Jev's choice, its confidence and the criterion it chose. Red is the Fix Jev asked for; green is the answer after the edit.</p>
{% if outcomes %}
  <div class="scroll"><table class="outcomes">
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Statement</th><th scope="col">Fired</th><th scope="col">Outcome</th><th scope="col">Why: {{ before_step | e }} → {{ after_step | e }}</th><th scope="col">Cleared by</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
{% for o in outcomes %}
      <tr>
        <td><span class="mono">{{ o.key | e }}</span><div class="small">{{ o.statement | e }}</div></td>
        <td class="mono">{{ o.before | e }} → {{ o.after | e }}</td>
        <td><span class="pill pill-{{ o.pill | e }}"><i></i>{{ o.state | e }}</span></td>
        <td>
{% for w in o.why %}
          <div class="why"><span class="mono q">{{ w.question | e }}</span>
{% if w.before %}<div class="was{% if w.before.failing %} fix{% endif %}"><b>{{ w.before.choice | e }}</b> <span class="mono muted">{{ w.before.confidence | e }} · {{ w.before.count | e }}/{{ w.before.of | e }}</span> {{ w.before.criterion | e }}</div>{% endif %}
{% if w.after %}<div class="now{% if w.after.failing %} fix{% endif %}"><b>{{ w.after.choice | e }}</b> <span class="mono muted">{{ w.after.confidence | e }} · {{ w.after.count | e }}/{{ w.after.of | e }}</span> {{ w.after.criterion | e }}</div>{% endif %}
          </div>
{% endfor %}
        </td>
        <td class="mono small">{% if o.fixed_by %}{{ o.fixed_by | e }}{% else %}-{% endif %}</td>
      </tr>
{% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
{% else %}
  <p class="small">No rule fired in either step.</p>
{% endif %}

  <h3 id="{{ dom | e }}-unsure">Unsure answers</h3>
  <p class="sub small">An answer below 0.6 confidence is unsure: the text leaves Jev undecided, and the same request can get a different answer next time. Each answer below 0.6 in either step, with Jev's choice and confidence before and after.</p>
{% if unsure %}
  <div class="scroll"><table>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Answer</th><th scope="col">{{ before_step | e }}</th><th scope="col">{{ after_step | e }}</th><th scope="col">Outcome</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
{% for u in unsure %}
      <tr><td><span class="mono">{{ u.key | e }}</span><div class="small">{{ u.statement | e }}</div></td>
        <td>{% if u.before %}{{ u.before.choice | e }} <span class="mono muted">{{ u.before.confidence | e }}</span>{% else %}-{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{% if u.after %}{{ u.after.choice | e }} <span class="mono muted">{{ u.after.confidence | e }}</span>{% else %}-{% endif %}</td>
        <td><span class="pill pill-{% if u.state == 'now confident' %}pass{% else %}unsure{% endif %}"><i></i>{{ u.state | e }}</span></td></tr>
{% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
{% else %}
  <p class="small">None: every answer is at 0.6 or above.</p>
{% endif %}

  <h3 id="{{ dom | e }}-chart">Confidence per answer</h3>
  <p class="sub small">Jev answers the same questions about every statement. Pick a question; each row is one statement and each dot is Jev's answer in one run, placed by how confident Jev was (0 to 1). Hollow circle = the original text, solid dot = the fixed text, light gray = the edits tried between them. Red = the answer asked for a fix. Left of the dashed 0.6 line the answer is unsure. Hover a row for the statement and the answers.</p>
  <div class="conf-chart" data-unit="{{ dom | e }}" data-chart="{{ chart_json | e }}"><div class="tabs chart-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Question"></div><div class="legend"></div><div class="chart-svg"></div></div>

  <h3 id="{{ dom | e }}-steps">Steps</h3>
  <div class="scroll"><table class="steps">
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Step</th><th scope="col">Runs</th><th scope="col">Runs passing</th><th scope="col">Unsure answers</th><th scope="col">Fails on</th><th scope="col">Clears (vs base)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
{% for s in steps %}
      <tr><td class="mono">{{ s.step | e }}</td><td class="mono">{{ s.runs | e }}</td><td><span class="pill pill-{{ s.status | e }}"><i></i>{{ s.tally | e }}</span></td><td class="mono">{{ s.unsure | e }}</td><td class="mono small">{{ s.fired | e }}</td><td class="mono small">{{ s.clears | e }}</td></tr>
{% for err in s.errors %}
      <tr><td></td><td colspan="5" class="small muted">{{ err | e }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table></div>

  <div class="card-head">
    <h3 id="{{ dom | e }}-text">Text: <span class="mono">original.md</span> → <span class="mono">current.md</span></h3>
{% if doc_html %}
    <div class="tabs" role="group" aria-label="Document view"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-doc="changes">Changes only</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-doc="whole">Whole document</button></div>
{% endif %}
  </div>
{% if doc_html %}
  <p class="sub small">The record's own section of {% if file %}<span class="mono">{{ file | e }}</span>{% else %}the file{% endif %}. {{ doc_stats | e }}. Struck red = removed, green = added.</p>
  <div class="doc">{{ doc_html | safe }}</div>
{% else %}
  <p class="small">The workspace has no original.md and current.md to compare.</p>
{% endif %}
{% for c in candidates %}
  <details>
    <summary>Candidate <span class="mono">{{ c.step | e }}</span>: its edit to original.md ({{ c.changed | e }} changed)</summary>
    <div class="tabs" role="group" aria-label="Document view"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-doc="changes">Changes only</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-doc="whole">Whole document</button></div>
    <div class="doc">{{ c.html | safe }}</div>
  </details>
{% endfor %}

  <h3 id="{{ dom | e }}-review">Drift review</h3>
{% if reviewed %}
  <div class="two">
    <div>
      <p class="small">Kept: tighter, more specific, testable or accurate.</p>
{% if review_kept %}
      <table><tbody>
{% for k in review_kept %}
        <tr><td><b>{{ k.change | e }}</b><div class="small">{{ k.why | e }}</div>{% if k.authority %}<div class="mono muted">{{ k.authority | e }}</div>{% endif %}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
      </tbody></table>
{% else %}
      <p class="small">None.</p>
{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="small">Discarded: drift from what the record's authority says.</p>
{% if review_discarded %}
      <table><tbody>
{% for k in review_discarded %}
        <tr><td><b>{{ k.change | e }}</b><div class="small">{{ k.why | e }}</div>{% if k.authority %}<div class="mono muted">{{ k.authority | e }}</div>{% endif %}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
      </tbody></table>
{% else %}
      <p class="small">None.</p>
{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
{% else %}
  <p class="small">No drift review was passed (--review).</p>
{% endif %}

  <details>
    <summary>All {{ runs | length }} runs</summary>
    <div class="scroll"><table>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Run</th><th scope="col">Step</th><th scope="col">Verdict</th><th scope="col">Unsure answers</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
{% for r in runs %}
        <tr><td class="mono">{{ r.run | e }}</td><td class="mono">{{ r.step | e }}</td><td>{{ r.verdict | e }}{% if r.error %} <span class="small muted">{{ r.error | e }}</span>{% endif %}</td><td class="mono">{{ r.unsure | e }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
  </details>
</section>
